@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Current student
GET {{baseUrl}}/student/me

### Materials
GET {{baseUrl}}/student/materials

### Notices
GET {{baseUrl}}/student/notices

### Tests
GET {{baseUrl}}/student/tests

### Ask tutor
POST {{baseUrl}}/student/tutor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Explain database normalization with a simple example."
}

### Submit a doubt
POST {{baseUrl}}/student/doubts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "DBMS",
  "question": "Can you explain the difference between 2NF and 3NF?"
}
